<view class="page course-page theme-{{theme}} {{pageMotion}}" style="padding-top: {{contentTop}}px;">
  <view class="page-heading">
    <view class="heading-title">语文 · 五年级上册</view>
  </view>
  <scroll-view class="unit-nav" scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="false">
    <view class="unit-nav-inner"><view wx:for="{{units}}" wx:key="id" class="press-card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="jumpUnit" hover-class="is-pressed">{{item.label}}</view></view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="course-units">
    <view wx:for="{{units}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="unit" id="{{unit.id}}" class="course-unit">
      <view class="unit-head"><view><text>{{unit.label}}</text><strong>第 {{unit.start}}—{{unit.end}} 课</strong></view><text>已认识 {{unit.completed}}/{{unit.total}} 个字</text></view>
      <view class="lesson-route">
        <view wx:for="{{unit.lessons}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="lesson" class="lesson-card press-card {{lesson.skimming ? 'skimming' : ''}}" data-id="{{lesson.id}}" bindtap="openLesson" hover-class="is-pressed">
          <text class="route-index">第 {{lesson.position}} 课{{lesson.skimming ? ' · 略读' : ''}}</text>
          <view class="route-scene"><image src="{{lesson.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load="true" /><view class="glyph-cloud"><text wx:for="{{lesson.glyphs}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="glyph">{{glyph}}</text></view></view>
          <view class="route-copy"><strong>{{lesson.title}}</strong><view><text>课内 {{lesson.total}} 字</text><text>已完成 {{lesson.count}}</text></view></view>
          <view class="route-arrow"><view class="ui-icon ui-icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></view></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="method-card"><strong>26</strong><text>精读课分会认、会写与多音字；略读课以会认和理解为主。教材正文不复制，所有讲解和练习都经过重新组织。</text></view>
</view>
